# ---------------- TK_Bullet.events (Task 16 Part H) ----------------
# TK4 bullet: flies along the shooter's facing, knocks the victim back, then dies.
#
# The scene's "Bullet" actor is only a template for `spawn Bullet at me`. The runtime marks
# real copies with `my spawnedFrom`, so the live blocks below are skipped on the template
# itself — a template that ran its own `destroy me` would vanish after one second.

# 400 cm/s over its 3 s life crosses ~12 m — TK4 shots reach across the screen rather than
# dying a metre out.
when every 0 seconds
  my spawnedFrom is "Bullet"
  move forward speed 400

when me touches Enemy
  # `for 0.2 seconds` keeps shoving, so the knockback is visible instead of a single frame.
  push other back strength 100 for 0.2 seconds
  send message "hit" to other
  destroy me

when every 3 seconds
  my spawnedFrom is "Bullet"
  destroy me
